# --- TimeVault (Go) -----------------------------------------------------------
# The rules above were inherited from another project. `config/` and `config.*`
# would hide the planned `internal/config` package, so re-include it.
!internal/config/
!internal/config/**
# Build output and local runtime state (data/ is already ignored above).
*.exe
*.test
*.out
/bin/
coverage.*
# The service's own settings file; it holds secrets (see configs/timevault.example.env).
/.env